          en: 'Arguing with [[kelly-funk|Kelly]] and [[bobby-funk|Bobby Funk]] in the colosseum’s waiting room, [[dagama|Dagama]] tells them to look around: every nation wants the Flame-Flame Fruit, and the room is full of notorious names. The first he points to is Suleiman the Beheader, a class-A war criminal who fought in the Sea Battle of Dias. After him come the former bounty hunters [[abdullah|Abdullah]] and [[jeet|Jeet]], who bombed a government institution, and [[bellamy|Bellamy]], who is sponsored by the Donquixote Family. Does anyone really believe, Dagama asks, that people like these are not plotting something?',
