          en: 'Abdullah and [[jeet|Jeet]] fall off [[ucy|Ucy]] at the mouth of the shortcut [[kelly-funk|Kelly Funk]] shows [[monkey-d-luffy|Luffy]], and overhear the brothers gloating that he fell for it. The tunnel is a dead-end well; when [[donquixote-doflamingo|Doflamingo]] appears inside and fires at the bull, the two of them slash and stab him from behind, and he turns out to be a string puppet. They pull Luffy, [[trafalgar-law|Law]] and the bull out of the water, and tell them how a Doflamingo took Kelly out in a split second when they went to stop him. Then Abdullah reports that the colosseum fighters have already reached the second level.',
