          en: 'Accused by [[kelly-funk|Kelly]] and [[bobby-funk|Bobby Funk]] of buying himself allies, [[dagama|Dagama]] retorts that everyone in the colosseum’s waiting room wants the Flame-Flame Fruit and everyone is plotting something, and he runs through the notorious names present. There is [[suleiman|Suleiman]] the Beheader, a war criminal from the Sea Battle of Dias. There are Jeet and his partner [[abdullah|Abdullah]], former bounty hunters who bombed a government institution. And there are [[bellamy|Bellamy]], [[cavendish|Cavendish]] and Bartolomeo. It would be crazy, Dagama concludes, to think they have no plan.',
