          en: 'In the colosseum’s waiting room a stranger in a fake beard, [[monkey-d-luffy|Luffy]] entered under the name Lucy, knocks down one of the house’s star gladiators, and a guard moves to disqualify him. Two men step in, and the crowd knows them at once: Boo and his brother [[sai|Sai]] of the Chinjao Family, from the Kano Kingdom, with the legendary [[don-chinjao|Don Chinjao]] beside them. The big one started it, they say, so he is the one who has to go. When Luffy thanks them, Sai flies at him for saying the word at all. Boo holds his brother back and apologises to the stranger: he is easily excited.',
