          en: 'In block C the announcer says the Happo Navy, with its centuries of history, is simply unbeatable, and Boo shows why: a single punch of his martial art sends [[kelly-funk|Kelly Funk]] flying, and he calls the boxer a shrimp while he does it. He turns next on the assassin’s younger brother, who turns his back and begs not to fight, since he has never been in a fight in his life, and brings an axe coated in Armament Haki down on him. The axe breaks. While Boo is still wondering how hard that body is, Kelly comes back bigger, like a different man, and batters him until he is out cold.',
